1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:01,480
Point your finger.

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,870
Now bend only the TIP.

3
00:00:04,291 --> 00:00:06,100
Middle joint bent too?

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,361
Sorry.

5
00:00:07,361 --> 00:00:08,760
The tip only comes

6
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,967
as a COMBO.

7
00:00:09,993 --> 00:00:11,050
See that string?

8
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,180
It pulls the tip

9
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,700
AND the middle joint.

10
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,650
Now hold the middle joint still,

11
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,416
and bend the tip.

12
00:00:17,615 --> 00:00:19,033
There it goes!

13
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,090
Congrats.

14
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:20,995
That's exactly how

15
00:00:20,995 --> 00:00:21,693
hand doctors

16
00:00:21,693 --> 00:00:23,200
check that string.

17
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:23,931
Let go,

18
00:00:23,931 --> 00:00:26,050
and the combo's back.

